attacker controls web

policy "SSH key never leaves, even if one agent is compromised"
  never ssh -> internet
  tolerate 1 agent

policy "AWS keys never leave, whatever the agents do"
  never aws -> internet
  tolerate any agents

policy "Web content never reaches production"
  never attacker -> prod

policy "No LLM agent ever sees cloud credentials"
  never aws -> coder, reviewer, browser
